# Accepted findings, each with a reason. Review when the design changes.

# Public ALB is intentional: it is the origin behind Cloudflare, and its
# security group only admits Cloudflare edge ranges.
AVD-AWS-0053
AWS-0053

# ECS tasks need outbound HTTPS to Anthropic, Paystack, Sentry and Grafana,
# whose IPs are not stable. Egress is limited to port 443.
AVD-AWS-0104
AWS-0104

# State bucket uses SSE-KMS with the AWS managed key. A CMK adds cost and a
# key policy to manage without a meaningful gain for this single-account setup.
AVD-AWS-0132
AWS-0132
